 "headline": "Tatum Torches Thug Life Early",
 "notes": [
  "White Mambas stole FG% and FT% from Gopher Gold while LeBron James sat on 4 points on 2-7 shooting. The King is a liability.",
  "Jayson Tatum has 34 points, 9 assists and five threes for theInfamous. Thug Life is getting buried while its guys wait for tip-off.",
  "Zero Fox Given got 33 points from Kyshawn George on 10-19 shooting and leads MONSTARS 8-3. The only thing MONSTARS have left is the second half.",
